# cisco_vios: prevent bootstrap stalls on a silent console.
#
# Upstream: https://github.com/srl-labs/vrnetlab/pull/548 (OPEN, not merged), fixes
#           https://github.com/srl-labs/vrnetlab/issues/547 (bootstrap stalls after the RETURN prompt).
# Related:  https://github.com/srl-labs/vrnetlab/issues/523 (stalls while applying startup-config),
#           https://github.com/srl-labs/vrnetlab/issues/555 (_Console drops data after a match).
# Touches only cisco/vios/docker/launch.py; verified to apply to vrnetlab a21b24b (srv4 checkout).
# NOTE: PR #548 states that startup-config application stalls (#523) are outside its scope.
# Applied by climg with `patch -p1` inside the build work copy; the vrnetlab checkout is never modified.
# Everything below this header is the unmodified `gh pr diff 548` output.
#
